  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: on Via Aurelia between Marta fl. and Graviscae</p>\r\n<p>Bonghi Jovino suggests that a quadrangular anomaly visible on the coast between the Mignone stream and Scolo dei Prati may be the site of the ancient\u00a0<em>statio</em>.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
